DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Magic is alive and well with our weekly Commander event! Bring your favorite deck (or five) and join our regulars for a casual Commander night. People bring all sorts of power level decks\, everything from precons up to cEDH—don't feel shy\, ask what people want to play and find a pod that matches your deck!\n\nEntry is pay-what-you-can (even if that's $0)\, and we recommend a $5 donation for those able to pay.
