DESCRIPTION:($5 entry) Every Wednesday at 6:30\, we play Pauper! Pauper is a longtime favorite MTG format for many where every card must have been printed at Common. That means decks tend to be very affordable\, but don’t be fooled—some of the most powerful spells in Magic can still be found in this format!
