DESCRIPTION:<p>The best of the best in Western North Carolina will be coming out to compete for their ticket to Season 5 Round 2's Regional Championships (RCs).</p><p>The winner will receive an invite to this season’s RC and a foil Pinnacle Starcage promo card\; top 8 will get a nonfoil Pinnacle Starcage promo\; all attendees will receive a Sunpearl Kirin promo.</p><p><b>As a sealed event\, players get to keep the cards in their sealed pool\, and the top 8 players also get to keep the cards in their draft pool</b>. Additional prizes will be given out depending on attendance\; see below!</p><p> [trimmed]
